Pipeline: Orchestrator

Purpose:
  Defines orchestrator pipeline — how user input flows through
  all engines to produce results.

Pipelines:
  NewProject:
    Intent → Discovery → Analysis → Architecture → Skills →
    Decision → Tasks → Dependencies → Workflow → BDD →
    Implementation → Test → Security → Performance →
    Infrastructure → Release → Deploy → Observe → Learn

  ExistingProject:
    Intent → Scan → Analysis → Detection → Mapping →
    Conflict → Baseline → Gaps → Tasks → Workflow →
    Parallel Execution

  CrossLayer:
    API Change → Impact Analysis → Multi-layer Tasks →
    Integration Test → Doc → Parallel Execution → Release

Rules:
  [PL1] Pipeline is adaptive, not linear.
  [PL2] Existing project starts with discovery, not architecture.
  [PL3] Cross-layer changes trigger multi-layer task creation.
  [PL4] Pipeline MUST support pause/resume for human approval.

State: +